  "notes": "Dallah Healthcare Company (ticker 4004) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/435_0_2026-03-12...). Auditor: KPMG Professional Services Company (auditor's report Riyadh, 22 Ramadan 1447H / 11 March 2026). The consolidated financial statements were authorised for issue by the Board of Directors on 15 Ramadan 1447H, corresponding to 4 March 2026 (Note 37). Amounts are presented in full Saudi Riyals (scale 1). The five primary statements (printed FS pages 6-10) are scanned images in the filed PDF (transcribed from page renders at 2.6x); the notes are digital text. Consolidated group with non-controlling interests; no discontinued operations in either year. The FY2024 comparative balance sheet carried SAR 118.5m of land as 'Assets held for sale' under IFRS 5 (measured at the lower of carrying amount and fair value); it is inside the FY2024 current-assets subtotal and was nil at FY2025 year-end, so no IFRS 5 subtotal adjustment is needed. intangible_assets is the combined 'Intangible assets and goodwill' line. investments_associates is 'Equity-accounted investees'; long_term_investments is 'Financial assets at fair value through other comprehensive income'. share_of_profit_associates is 'Group share of results from equity accounted investees' (presented below operating profit). impairment_charges is the 'Impairment loss on trade receivables' P&L line. operating_income is the reported 'Operating profit'; finance_costs is the 'Finance cost' line. income_before_income_taxes_and_zakat is 'Profit before zakat'; income_taxes_and_zakat is the single 'Zakat' line (the group pays zakat, not income tax). additional_paid_in_capital is 'Share premium'; treasury_shares is the 'Treasury shares' contra-equity line; other_reserves combines the 'Statutory reserve' and the negative 'Fair value reserve'. due_from_related_parties is 'Due from related parties and others'; contract_assets is 'Unbilled revenue'. long_term_debt is 'Long-term murabaha financing'; current_debt sums 'Short-term murabaha financing' and 'Current portion of long-term murabaha financing'. lease_liabilities_noncurrent / lease_liabilities_current are the long-term / short-term lease liabilities. defined_benefit_obligation is 'Employee benefits'; other_noncurrent_liabilities is 'Long-term payables'; related_party_payables is 'Due to related parties and others'; accrued_expenses is 'Accrued expenses and other current liabilities'; zakat_payable is 'Provision for zakat'. depreciation_amortization sums 'Depreciation on property and equipment', 'Depreciation on right-of-use assets' and 'Amortization on intangible assets and goodwill' from the cash-flow statement. capex is 'Acquisition of property and equipment'; interest_paid is 'Finance cost paid'; zakat_paid is 'Zakat paid'; dividends_paid is 'Dividend paid' to the Company's shareholders. In FY2025 the group also paid SAR 435.3m to acquire additional non-controlling interest in a subsidiary and SAR 313.8m (net of cash) to acquire subsidiaries, driving total assets up ~38%. The cash-flow closing balance equals the balance-sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' line exactly. Statement page references are the printed FS page numbers: financial position 6, profit or loss 7, comprehensive income 8, changes in equity 9, cash flows 10.",
